  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Cub Inventory QAS — Observabilidad",
      "id": 100,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Demo para el profesor\nStack **Prometheus + Loki + Tempo + Alloy + Grafana + Alertmanager** (OpenTelemetry).\n\n1. Navega Cub (`admin/admin123`) → dashboard/productos.\n2. Mira **req/s**, **p95**, gauges de negocio y **logs** abajo (`service_name=backend`).\n3. En Security: fuerza 401 (sin token) y 403 (viewer en `/users`).\n4. Alertmanager: alerta informativa **CubStackHeartbeat** = Prometheus → Alertmanager OK.\n\n| Dashboard | Que demuestra |\n|---|---|\n| API / Infra / Business / Security | Metricas PDF + logs con user/endpoint |"
      }
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [{ "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "DOWN", "color": "red" }, "1": { "text": "UP", "color": "green" } } }],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 3, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "id": 1,
      "title": "API",
      "type": "stat",
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "auto" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "up{job=\"inventory-api\"}", "legendFormat": "api" }]
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [{ "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "DOWN", "color": "red" }, "1": { "text": "UP", "color": "green" } } }],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 3, "x": 3, "y": 4 },
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Prometheus",
      "type": "stat",
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "up{job=\"prometheus\"}", "legendFormat": "prom" }]
    },
    {
